1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,933
This is Market Claim Verifier.

2
00:00:05,233 --> 00:00:07,000
Finance posts move fast.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:12,400
Some numbers are right, some are
quietly wrong, and almost nobody checks.

4
00:00:18,133 --> 00:00:21,800
Ask a language model on
its own and it guesses.

5
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:23,500
On 357 finance claims,

6
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:28,800
Muse Spark from memory was right
only 20 to 44 percent of the time.

7
00:00:31,133 --> 00:00:31,966
Paste a post.

8
00:00:31,966 --> 00:00:36,100
Muse Spark pulls out each checkable
claim with its exact quote.

9
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:39,233
Forecasts and opinions
are labeled, not judged.

10
00:00:44,166 --> 00:00:47,866
An agent looks up SEC data for each one.

11
00:00:47,866 --> 00:00:49,933
Amazon, 143.1 billion:

12
00:00:49,933 --> 00:00:50,366
true.

13
00:00:50,366 --> 00:00:52,700
NVIDIA, more than double:

14
00:00:52,700 --> 00:00:53,166
true.

15
00:00:53,166 --> 00:00:56,300
Apple, 416 billion in one quarter:

16
00:00:56,300 --> 00:00:56,866
false.

17
00:00:56,866 --> 00:00:58,900
That's the whole year.

18
00:00:58,900 --> 00:01:01,733
The quarter was 102.5 billion.

19
00:01:13,366 --> 00:01:15,266
Every verdict links to proof:

20
00:01:15,266 --> 00:01:20,333
the exact table row in the 10-K or 10-Q,
number highlighted, one click to the

21
00:01:20,333 --> 00:01:21,400
original filing.

22
00:01:34,466 --> 00:01:35,466
The key design:

23
00:01:35,466 --> 00:01:38,100
the model proposes, the program decides.

24
00:01:38,100 --> 00:01:41,033
Code re-reads the number
and its precision,

25
00:01:41,033 --> 00:01:46,166
checks fiscal and calendar years, and
rejects any evidence the model made up.

26
00:01:57,266 --> 00:02:00,500
We committed the answers
before running anything.

27
00:02:00,500 --> 00:02:02,466
With tools and program checks:

28
00:02:02,466 --> 00:02:07,900
83 percent on the Meta Model API, and 90.5
percent with open-weight Muse Spark on

29
00:02:07,900 --> 00:02:09,366
Baseten and Fireworks.

30
00:02:20,033 --> 00:02:21,766
It works in Chinese too.

31
00:02:28,366 --> 00:02:30,466
Built this week for the Meta hackathon.

32
00:02:30,466 --> 00:02:33,766
Try the live demo, and check
the number before you share it.

